{# product_tile — Product tile (type layouts plan C2): a Product list card's picture, first category
   and quick Add to cart and wishlist buttons, exactly as a shop grid card's tile
   (`shop/_product_tile.twig`, shared with `shop/_product_card.twig`). Its internals are fixed — the
   grid's cart honesty decides the quick add — and `hide_tag` and `hide_actions` are its settings.
   It reads the card's product, so it has something to show only inside a card. #}
{% set product = layout_context.product|default(null) %}
{% if product %}
{% include 'shop/_product_tile.twig' with {
  product: product,
  show_tag: not data.hide_tag|default(false),
  show_actions: not data.hide_actions|default(false),
  tile_class: ' thallo-block thallo-block-product_tile' ~ style_classes('root'),
  tile_attrs: style_attrs('root'),
} only %}
{% endif %}
